# A Slack connect's app on its page on the desktop (sfdesk slack_app.mbt, the web's pages/SlackApp.tsx): MBUI_WIN=1280x800
# over the made-up chat. 连接 from the rail, a connect opened, its Slack app unfolded, its permissions unfolded.
timeout 30000
until 按空格输入
wait 600
tap icon:im
wait 1500
tap 星火助手
wait 1500
tap Slack app
wait 1500
tap 权限 · 已开启 4 / 16 项
wait 1500
exit
